# Atlas Core Component Design Tokens Specification
**Author:** Torq Nkosi  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D16 06:10  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Strict mathematical and semantic component design token specification for Project Atlas Core, codified in DTCG format derived from specifications in Business Document: Company Document.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "$metadata": {
    "project": "Atlas Core",
    "author": "Torq Nkosi",
    "role": "Design (Data Purist)",
    "sourceDocument": "Business Document: Company Document",
    "provenanceDescription": "The typography scales, accessibility contrast thresholds (WCAG 2.1 AA 4.5:1 min), and hybrid SaaS/Face-to-Face touch target metrics defined in Business Document: Company Document were extracted and codified directly into the semantic component tokens below."
  },
  "component": {
    "button": {
      "primary": {
        "background": {
          "$value": "#0F172A",
          "$type": "color",
          "$description": "Derived from Brand Primary in Business Document: Company Document"
        },
        "foreground": {
          "$value": "#F8FAFC",
          "$type": "color"
        },
        "padding": {
          "x": { "$value": "16px", "$type": "dimension" },
          "y": { "$value": "10px", "$type": "dimension" }
        },
        "minTouchTarget": {
          "$value": "48px",
          "$type": "dimension",
          "$description": "Face-to-face tablet/kiosk minimum touch target per Business Document: Company Document compliance"
        },
        "radius": { "$value": "6px", "$type": "dimension" }
      }
    },
    "card": {
      "surface": {
        "background": { "$value": "#FFFFFF", "$type": "color" },
        "border": { "$value": "1px solid #E2E8F0", "$type": "border" },
        "radius": { "$value": "8px", "$type": "dimension" },
        "shadow": { "$value": "0 1px 3px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)", "$type": "shadow" }
      }
    },
    "input": {
      "height": { "$value": "40px", "$type": "dimension" },
      "border": { "$value": "1px solid #CBD5E1", "$type": "border" },
      "focusRing": { "$value": "2px solid #2563EB", "$type": "border" }
    }
  }
}
```